<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.9.4">
<l>niccalun tōḻimīrkā ḷemmainīrnalin teṉceytīrō</l>
<l>paccilai nīḷkamukum palavunteṅkum vāḻaikaḷu</l>
<l>maccaṇi māṭaṅkaṇmī taṇavuntaṇ ṭiruvallavāḻ</l>
<l>naccara viṉaṇaimē ṉampirāṉatu naṉṉalamē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Always, friends, what will you do, afflicting us?</l>
<l>The good beauty of our lord on the bed of the troublesome serpent</l>
<l>in cool Tiruvallavāḻ, where green-leaved long Areca palms, jack trees, coconut trees</l>
<l>and plantains cling to the top of storied mansions adorned with roof terraces?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
